{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "GHOST OF THE DICED STEAK",
    "steam_appid": 3855620,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Little Bit Difficult.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game where you control a diced steak and aim for the goal located deep within each stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it\u2019s not just any diced steak. This steak has the power to create ghosts. These ghosts replicate your past actions and can be strategically used to overcome obstacles. There are two types of ghosts:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One that you can create at any time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One that appears when you die and replays your previous run</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a steak, touching a hot iron plate will cook you. If you get too cooked and become burnt to a crisp, you\u2019ll be discarded. Well-done is nice and all, but try to make it through while staying as rare as possible.<br>\u30fbPlay Time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximately 1\u20135 hours (depending on difficulty and player skill)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u30fbStage</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only one large stage, composed of six distinct areas.<br>There are 14 checkpoints throughout the stage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u30fbSelectable Difficulties (4 levels)</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EASY</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NORMAL</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HARD</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1STEAK</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(The skin you unlock upon clearing changes depending on the selected difficulty.)</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Essential Techniques</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u30fbDouble Jump</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855620/extras/dbfc4c03ac39dc0d8fa07527f1735ce7.poster.avif?t=1754211835\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855620/extras/dbfc4c03ac39dc0d8fa07527f1735ce7.webm?t=1754211835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855620/extras/dbfc4c03ac39dc0d8fa07527f1735ce7.mp4?t=1754211835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start recording a ghost just as you jump, then stop the recording at the peak of your jump and immediately spawn the ghost. By jumping right as the ghost collides with your steak, you can perform a double jump. With skill, even triple or quadruple jumps are possible.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u30fbSmash Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855620/extras/2969625543d75c63ca371410d45086c9.poster.avif?t=1754211835\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855620/extras/2969625543d75c63ca371410d45086c9.webm?t=1754211835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855620/extras/2969625543d75c63ca371410d45086c9.mp4?t=1754211835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The smash action greatly improves your control. It provides posture correction and downward force, allowing you to land more accurately. Even if you slightly miss a platform, you can sometimes recover using this action.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Video &amp; Streaming Guidelines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recording and streaming are allowed. Monetization is also permitted.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Little Bit Difficult.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game where you control a diced steak and aim for the goal located deep within each stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it\u2019s not just any diced steak. This steak has the power to create ghosts. These ghosts replicate your past actions and can be strategically used to overcome obstacles. There are two types of ghosts:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One that you can create at any time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One that appears when you die and replays your previous run</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a steak, touching a hot iron plate will cook you. If you get too cooked and become burnt to a crisp, you\u2019ll be discarded. Well-done is nice and all, but try to make it through while staying as rare as possible.<br>\u30fbPlay Time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximately 1\u20135 hours (depending on difficulty and player skill)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u30fbStage</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only one large stage, composed of six distinct areas.<br>There are 14 checkpoints throughout the stage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u30fbSelectable Difficulties (4 levels)</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EASY</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NORMAL</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HARD</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1STEAK</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(The skin you unlock upon clearing changes depending on the selected difficulty.)</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Essential Techniques</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u30fbDouble Jump</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855620/extras/dbfc4c03ac39dc0d8fa07527f1735ce7.poster.avif?t=1754211835\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855620/extras/dbfc4c03ac39dc0d8fa07527f1735ce7.webm?t=1754211835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855620/extras/dbfc4c03ac39dc0d8fa07527f1735ce7.mp4?t=1754211835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start recording a ghost just as you jump, then stop the recording at the peak of your jump and immediately spawn the ghost. By jumping right as the ghost collides with your steak, you can perform a double jump. With skill, even triple or quadruple jumps are possible.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u30fbSmash Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855620/extras/2969625543d75c63ca371410d45086c9.poster.avif?t=1754211835\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855620/extras/2969625543d75c63ca371410d45086c9.webm?t=1754211835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855620/extras/2969625543d75c63ca371410d45086c9.mp4?t=1754211835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The smash action greatly improves your control. It provides posture correction and downward force, allowing you to land more accurately. Even if you slightly miss a platform, you can sometimes recover using this action.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Video &amp; Streaming Guidelines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recording and streaming are allowed. Monetization is also permitted.</p>",
